- [ ] `libra config set/unset/remove-section/rename-section/import` 对 Memory-owned `memory.keyed_digest.v1` 明确拒绝或安全跳过；读/list 永久脱敏，不输出 seed/derived key；有 mutation/redaction/import 回归。

